#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/features/companion.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "桌面伴侣（Companion）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Dynamic SAP 卫星**：单体桌面 GUI 应用，不经 `config.yaml` managed 托管。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"桌面伴侣是 SAP **Type B** 应用（embedded sidecar 持 Hub WebSocket、`relay: "
"false`）：**内容包**（React + VRM + Node sidecar）由通用 **app/desktop** 嵌"
"入，通过 SAP 向 Hub 注册并向 Agent 暴露本地工具。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "架构"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/companion.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FreeAnima Desktop（app/desktop）\n"
"├── Electron Main — 托盘/多窗 + 内嵌 companion sidecar\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — 透明置顶，VRM / 气泡\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — 设置窗\n"
"│   ├── chat — 聊天室 SPA（SAP 直连，无 sidecar）\n"
"│   └── admin — 管理台 WebView（Hub REST）\n"
"└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell；companion API 走 localhost sidecar\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS\n"
"    anima service Hub\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:26
msgid ""
"内容包位于 [`satellites/companion/`](../../satellites/companion/)（`app/` + "
"`server/` + `shared/`），导出约定见 [`frontend-exports.md`](../sap/frontend-"
"exports.md)。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:28
msgid "与 Chat / 结对编程的区别："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|             | Chat / 结对编程              | Companion                                    |\n"
"| ----------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | 浏览器 Web UI                | 原生透明伴侣窗 + 独立设置窗                  |\n"
"| 部署        | Managed（可与 service 同机） | Dynamic（用户自行启动）                      |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A 或 Type B + relay     | Type B + tools，无 relay                     |\n"
"| 客户端与 UI | 可分离                       | 伴侣渲染与设置窗分离，同属一个 Electron 应用 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "功能"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"VRM 角色渲染（Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`）；VRM 1.0 与 0.x 自动校正朝向"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**动作槽位（Motion Slot）**：`idle`、`rest`、`walk`、`climb`、`in_place` 五个"
"槽位；每槽位可绑定 0..n 个 VRMA，播放时指定或随机；槽位为空则不播放动画"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**文字气泡**：单向文字队列；用户点击切换下一条，不自动消失；由 Hub Agent 通"
"过 `companion.bubble` 工具推送"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid "透明置顶 companion 窗（160×260）+ 角色区域可点、空白穿透"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**本地交互**：拖拽移动窗口；点击身体任意部位从 `in_place` 槽位随机播放动作"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**巡逻**（可在设置 → 行为 Tab 配置）：空闲自动巡逻、双击巡逻、角点停顿、巡逻"
"速度、启动归位等"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid "系统托盘：显示/隐藏伴侣、打开设置、退出"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid "设置窗 Tab：**通用** / **行为** / **模型** / **动作槽位** / **动作库**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent 工具（sidecar 注册）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 工具        | 参数                                 | 说明                           |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | 文字入气泡队列                 |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`；`motion_id?: string` | 播放动作槽位；`motion_id` 可选 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:55
msgid ""
"定时笑话等周期性内容在 **anima service / 定时任务** 侧配置，由 Agent 调用 "
"`bubble` 推送；Companion 不内置定时器。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "模型与动作"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:59
msgid ""
"仓库**不捆绑** `.vrm` / `.vrma` 文件。配置持久化在 `~/.anima/companion/"
"config.json`（含 `models`、`motion_library`、`motion_slots`、`behavior`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRM 模型"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:63
msgid ""
"在设置 → **模型** Tab：列表、导入、删除、重命名、切换当前模型。文件保存到 "
"`~/.anima/companion/models/`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:65
msgid "开发期可将文件放入 `satellites/companion/public/models/` 作为回退目录。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRMA 动作库与槽位"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:69
msgid ""
"在设置 → **动作库** Tab 导入 VRMA 动作包 ZIP 或单个文件；在 **动作槽位** Tab "
"为各槽位勾选动作。动作库预览区支持鼠标拖拽旋转视角。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:71
msgid ""
"动作文件目录：`~/.anima/companion/motions/`。未绑定槽位时不播放对应动画；巡逻"
"位移仍会平移窗口，仅在有 `walk` / `climb` VRMA 时播放移动动画。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "开发与运行"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "浏览器开发（无需 Electron）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun satellites/companion/dev.ts\n"
"# 伴侣：http://127.0.0.1:4176\n"
"# 设置：页面内「设置」按钮打开面板弹窗（非独立路由）\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electron 桌面壳（含伴侣 + 聊天室 + 管理台）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd app/desktop\n"
"bun install\n"
"bun dev:electron\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:91
msgid "打包："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd app/desktop\n"
"bun run build:windows:installer   # Windows NSIS\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:98
msgid "环境变量："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 变量                     | 默认                    | 说明                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL`          | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | 无 `shell-client.json` 时的 Hub 回退地址 |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT`         | `4176`                  | 本地 HTTP 端口                           |\n"
"| `COMPANION_VRMA_ZIP_URL` | （空）                  | 可选；直链 zip 镜像，启动时下载          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:106
msgid ""
"Hub 地址与远程 Token 由桌面壳 **`~/.anima/shell-client.json`** 统一管理（托"
"盘 → **Hub 设置…**）。伴侣设置 → 通用 Tab 只读展示 Hub 地址。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:108
msgid ""
"Hub 在首次 `connect` 时分配 **3 字符** `instance_id`，写入 `~/.anima/"
"companion/instance.json`（非 `satellites/` 子目录）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 现象             | 处理                                                                               |\n"
"| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 双击无窗口       | 看系统托盘；托盘 → **设置…** 导入 `.vrm`                                           |\n"
"| 点击无动作       | 设置 → **动作库** 导入 VRMA；**动作槽位** 绑定对应槽位                             |\n"
"| 无法连 Hub       | 确认 `anima service` 与 `remote_auth.token`；托盘 **Hub 设置** 中地址与 token 正确 |\n"
"| 动作导入后无变化 | 导入后会热重载；若仍无效，确认槽位已勾选对应动作                                   |\n"
"| 后台服务失败     | 查看 `~/.anima/app/desktop/shell.log`；确认端口 4176–4185 可用                     |\n"
msgstr ""

